{
 "summary": "Checkout p95 latency rose above 1s at 00:27:22Z on gateway, orders and inventory at the same time, reaching about 2.4s, with no 5xx errors. Sampled slow traces put most of the self time in inventory POST /reserve (release 3.1.5), so inventory is the likely origin and gateway and orders are only waiting on it. The cause inside inventory is not shown: logs and deployment records returned nothing for the window.",
